he answer might be to join  twitch or Discord these companies deal  with much more traditional engineering  skills like integration with AWS so  you'd be able to participate in it and  to grow with the Gaming Community while  not being subject to its various  pitfalls and if enough people start  thinking like this and they move away  from traditional development companies  then maybe the situation it may just get  better but that's just what I think  would you want to be a game developer  comment that down below also drop a like  if you hope that conditions at these  gaming companies get better and of  course consider checking out our Discord  Community it suggest for your video  ideas and consider subscribing to see  more questions as you answered until  then I'm Hari and I'll see you guys on  the next one


